  "body": "Hi @mromidev! 👋\n\nFantastic work on **`claude-animated-shorts` (`cartoon-3d-short`)** — combining 2D ink-outlined cartoon characters inside a 3D painted Three.js + Remotion town with a measured `STYLE_BIBLE.md` (1,200 reference frames across 20 viral shorts) and automated Python + FFmpeg audio ducking makes deterministic 60-second storytelling accessible right inside Claude Code.\n\nWe just featured `mromidev/claude-animated-shorts` in a dedicated creator tutorial on **WaveWeaver (`waveweaver.io`)**, covering:\n- Step-by-step installation into `~/.claude/skills/cartoon-3d-short/` and configuring `REMOTION_TMP` for the `~1.3 GB` `public/` bundle\n- Breakdown of the 7-step `SKILL.md` workflow, `templates/bridge/`, and `templates/audio/`\n- How storytelling creators pair `claude-animated-shorts` renders with expressive character voiceovers and multi-platform scheduling\n\n🔗 **Full Creator Guide**: https://waveweaver.io/tools/claude-animated-shorts\n🔗 **Creator Hub**: https://waveweaver.io/\n\nWe linked directly to `github.com/mromidev/claude-animated-shorts`. Congrats on surging past 1,210+ GitHub stars (+580 stars/day)! 🎬",
